ine-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SmboDXn0vj9BmT0ibYJYly7P4x2sfTYPiaA4iap782oEf5jqu8g23VX24wamvNjL1doY3xzkpIgu9WA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n            关于蓝色火山庄园\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span>\n           蓝色火山庄园位于哥斯达黎加西部山谷的阿拉胡埃拉地区，\n          </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span>\n            哥斯达黎加著名的波阿斯火山的山坡上，\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n           由Alejo Castro经营。Alejo是Castro Kahle家族的第五代，他是一位知识渊博的咖啡种植者，庄园历史悠久，可以追溯到19世纪中后期。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SmboDXn0vj9BmT0ibYJYly7qxJQ4wtQK9NV7w5d8MLZIKPx1uzfliassZaeRciaTeNbOj5CsXLicdGbA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n           19世纪中期，当咖啡种植业在美洲刚刚起步时，两位企业家也是先驱者，哥斯达黎加的Alejo Castro Jiménez（现庄园主Alejo的曾祖父）和生活在墨西哥南部的Wilhelm Kahle，怀揣着同样的梦想：“生产世界上最好的咖啡”，以满足新兴的欧洲饕客市场。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SmboDXn0vj9BmT0ibYJYly7wCaNGqwiaBsGKnSq0KUOPSyW9DkEiaonVV6biaP0zsuVoMOBzQibPNDk6w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;'>\n<span>\n           庄园种植的咖啡品种非常丰富，有 SL28、卡杜拉、欧巴塔、薇拉沙奇、瑰夏等等。Alejo每个新产季都会尝试种植新品种，为应对气候变化对其收成产生的负面影响减到最小。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n           客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
